<h3>Introduction</h3>

<p>The purpose of the Status Flag macro is to give a 
constrained quick glance status icon.</p>

<h3>Flag Colors and Styles</h3>

<table border="1" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
<tr>
   <th>Style</th>
   <th>Grey</th>
   <th>Green</th>
   <th>Yellow</th>
   <th>Red</th>
   <th>Blue</th>
</tr>
<tr>
   <th>Large Flag</th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greyFlagLarge" alt="Grey" height="72" width="72" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greenFlagLarge" alt="Green" height="72" width="72" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$yellowFlagLarge" alt="Yellow" height="72" width="72" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$redFlagLarge" alt="Red" height="72" width="72" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$blueFlagLarge" alt="Blue" height="72" width="72" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
   <th>Medium Flag</th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greyFlagMedium" alt="Grey" height="48" width="48" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greenFlagMedium" alt="Green" height="48" width="48" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$yellowFlagMedium" alt="Yellow" height="48" width="48" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$redFlagMedium" alt="Red" height="48" width="48" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$blueFlagMedium" alt="Blue" height="48" width="48" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
   <th>Small Flag</th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greyFlagSmall" alt="Grey" height="24" width="24" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greenFlagSmall" alt="Green" height="24" width="24" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$yellowFlagSmall" alt="Yellow" height="24" width="24" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$redFlagSmall" alt="Red" height="24" width="24" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$blueFlagSmall" alt="Blue" height="24" width="24" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
   <th>Rounded Rectangle</th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greyBar" alt="Grey" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greenBar" alt="Green" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$yellowBar" alt="Yellow" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$redBar" alt="Red" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$blueBar" alt="Blue" height="18" width="88" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
   <th>On Track Indicators</th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greyTrack" alt="Pre-CON" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$greenTrack" alt="On Track" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$yellowTrack" alt="On Track" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$redTrack" alt="Off Track" height="18" width="88" /></th>
   <th><img src="$imagesDir/$blueTrack" alt="On Hold" height="18" width="88" /></th>
</tr>
</table>

<h3>Parameters</h3>

<p><strong>Color</strong>:The color of the flag.</p>
<p><strong>Style</strong>:The style of the flag.</p>
